      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 10,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "No backprop.\nJust mean activations or\ncontrasting prompts, then\nadd back at another prompt.\nCheap and reversible.",
